    "collection_url": "http://www.wheatandwildflower.ca/collections/always-be-a-viking",
    "description": "<p><strong>Always be a Viking.</strong><br><em>Be Strong.  Be Brave.  Be Kind.</em></p>\n<p>This whimsical collection pays tribute to the Vikings.  Brave Norse who sailed their longships to settle around the world.  These practical yet adorable garments and accessories pay tribute to the rich history of the Vikings and their modern descendants.<br></p>\n<p>A full range of items including baby gift sets, tank tops, pullovers, toques, scrunchies and headbands are available for sale at the <a href=\"nihm.ca\" title=\"New Icelandic Heritage Museum\" target=\"_blank\">New Iceland Heritage Museum</a> in Gimli.<br><br><em>I am working hard to restock this collection.  Pullovers and baby gift sets will be available online again soon!</em></p>",
